<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<title>Welcome to Epilog</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;">
{% set sans = "-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" %}
{% set serif = "Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif" %}
{% set ink = "#111111" %}
{% set muted = "#6e6e6e" %}
{% set faint = "#999999" %}
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">
  Reply with the Instagram accounts you want to follow.{% for _ in range(80) %}&#8199;&#847;{% endfor %}
</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#ffffff;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px 48px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:400px;font-family:{{ sans }};color:{{ ink }};">

  <tr><td style="padding:0 0 28px;">
    <div style="font-family:{{ serif }};font-size:56px;line-height:1;" aria-label="Epilog">⁕</div>
  </td></tr>

  <tr><td style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;padding:0 0 16px;">Welcome to Epilog</td></tr>

  <tr><td style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;padding:0 0 20px;">
    Epilog is set up. Each day at {{ digest_time }} it’ll email you what the accounts you follow posted on Instagram.
  </td></tr>

  <tr><td style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;padding:0 0 12px;">
    <strong>Reply to this email with the accounts you want to follow</strong>, one per line:
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:0 0 20px;">
    <div style="font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;background:#f2f2f2;padding:12px 16px;color:{{ ink }};">
      @yourfavoritebakery<br>@a.local.gallery<br>@that.record.shop
    </div>
  </td></tr>

  <tr><td style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;padding:0 0 20px;">
    You’ll get a confirmation within about 15 minutes, followed by a first digest of their posts from the past week.
  </td></tr>

  <tr><td style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:{{ muted }};padding:20px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;">
    <div style="padding-bottom:10px;"><strong style="color:{{ ink }};">Which accounts work?</strong> Business and Creator accounts, which covers most brands, shops, artists, musicians and publications. Instagram’s API doesn’t allow reading personal accounts; Epilog will tell you if any you send are personal.</div>
    <div style="padding-bottom:10px;"><strong style="color:{{ ink }};">Changing your list later:</strong> reply to any digest with more handles, or “remove @handle”.</div>
  </td></tr>

  <tr><td style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:{{ faint }};padding:16px 0 0;">
    Epilog is a free, open-source project using Instagram’s official API. <a href="https://karavaldon.com/epilog" style="color:{{ muted }};text-decoration:underline;">karavaldon.com/epilog</a>
  </td></tr>

</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
